SUMMARY:Lancaster City's May First Friday
DESCRIPTION:Join the City of Lancaster for First Friday at Binns Park & Ewell Plaza! Each month will include an arts market\, beer garden\, food trucks\, salsa and bachata\, and more. \n\n\n\nBachata at Binns 6:30 Kids Classes (all ages)7:00 Adult Classes (bachata and salsa basics)7:30-8:30 Open Social Dance \n\n\n\nFree First Friday Trolley \n\n\n\nFood & BeverageRural City Beer GardenLancaster Soft Pretzel \n\n\n\nArt MarketView vendors here. \n\n\n\nAfter you visit Binns & Ewell\, we encourage you to explore what the rest of Lancaster City has to offer on First Friday!
URL:https://visitlancastercity.com/event/lancaster-citys-may-first-friday/
